    "first_attempt": "Schema 1 of this file (attempt U0a) gave every case one universal expectation shared by all scheduling readers, so a blank line inside a block was refused by the ordinary reader too and a bare `key:` was read as []. The U0a-r1 adjudication replaced that with the fixed per-consumer projections below; the first attempt's bytes remain archived with that attempt.",
